# spvsimplify keyword + its sink/advice/assume options (parse.c/spirv.c) — NO stress area
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions
```spv
%c = OpIMul %uint %x %uint_4
%d = OpUDiv %uint %c %uint_2
OpStore %out %d
```
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions budget 0.5
```spv
%a = OpBitFieldUExtract %uint %x %uint_0 %uint_8
OpStore %out %a
```
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions advice
```spv
%c = OpIMul %uint %x %uint_4
OpStore %out %c
```
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions sink rgba8
```spv
%c = OpIMul %uint %x %uint_4
OpStore %out %c
```
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions sink int
```spv
%c = OpSDiv %int %x %int_2
OpStore %out %c
```
spvsimplify nofile nofunctions assume x 0 31
```spv
%c = OpUDiv %uint %x %uint_4
OpStore %out %c
```
